<div class="page">
  <h3 style="font-size: 14pt;">B. Scope of Work - Request for Professional Services Proposal</h3>
  <p>
    <span data-field="organization_name">{{ organization_name }}</span> requests proposals for the audit and certification of the following:
  </p>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 40px;">
    <li>University financial statements for the fiscal years ended <span data-field="audit_year_1">{{ audit_year_1 }}</span>. The report shall be submitted no later than <span data-field="audit_report_deadline_1">{{ audit_report_deadline_1 }}</span> following the close of the fiscal year under audit.</li>
    <li>Federal financial assistance and related compliance and internal control reports as required by OMB Circular A-133 for the fiscal years ended <span data-field="audit_year_2">{{ audit_year_2 }}</span>. The report shall be submitted no later than <span data-field="audit_report_deadline_2">{{ audit_report_deadline_2 }}</span> following the close of the fiscal year under audit.</li>
    <li>University’s statement of Institutional Assistance Grant revenues, expenditures, and changes in net assets for the fiscal years ended <span data-field="audit_year_3">{{ audit_year_3 }}</span>. The report shall be submitted no later than <span data-field="audit_report_deadline_3">{{ audit_report_deadline_3 }}</span> following the close of the fiscal year under audit.</li>
    <li>Assessment of <span data-field="organization_name">{{ organization_name }}</span>’s IT environment and general controls for the fiscal years ended <span data-field="audit_year_4">{{ audit_year_4 }}</span>. The report shall be submitted no later than <span data-field="audit_report_deadline_4">{{ audit_report_deadline_4 }}</span> following the close of the fiscal year under audit. For purposes of this RFP, the University use of the term “assessment” contemplates controls over:</li>
  </ul>
  <ul style="list-style-type: circle; margin-left: 60px;">
    <li>Physical security and environmental threats;</li>
    <li>Access management over infrastructure, applications, and data;</li>
    <li>Program change management;</li>
    <li>System and data backup and recovery management;</li>
    <li>Computer operation; and</li>
    <li>System development life cycle.</li>
  </ul>
  <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
    E. Limited-scope audit of the financial statements of <span data-field="organization_name">{{ organization_name }}</span>’s Defined Contribution Plan at December 31, 2019, 2020, and 2021. The report shall be submitted to the University no later than <span data-field="ldcp_report_deadline">{{ ldcp_report_deadline }}</span> following the close of the most recent Plan year.
  </p>
  <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
    In addition to the certification of the above deliverables, a management letter related to <span data-field="organization_name">{{ organization_name }}</span>’s internal controls and management systems should be prepared for the Board of Trustees’ Enterprise Risk Management and Audit Committee annually by the same dates indicated above.
  </p>
  <h3 style="font-size: 14pt;">2. Preparation Services.</h3>
  <p>
    <span data-field="organization_name">{{ organization_name }}</span> requests proposals for the preparation of the following:
  </p>
  <ul style="list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 40px;">
    <li>Form 990 return for <span data-field="organization_name">{{ organization_name }}</span>. The report shall be submitted to <span data-field="organization_name">{{ organization_name }}</span>’s Enterprise Risk Management and Audit Committee no later than <span data-field="form990_deadline">{{ form990_deadline }}</span> following the close of the recent fiscal year.</li>
    <li>Pennsylvania Charitable Organization Registration Statement (BCO-10). The annual renewal must be refiled no later than <span data-field="bco10_deadline">{{ bco10_deadline }}</span> following the close of the recent fiscal year.</li>
    <li>Annual return/report of Employee Benefit Plan (Form 5500). The report shall be completed no later than <span data-field="form5500_deadline">{{ form5500_deadline }}</span> following the close of the most recent Plan year.</li>
  </ul>
</div>

